<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings said analysts Patrick Jurezak and Vera Rossi downgraded their rating on Brazilian telecommunications company Telebras to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said downgrade was based on stock's valuation and the results of the B-Band cellular auction for Region 1.</p>
<p>-- said stock is within 13 percent of ING Barings' 12-month price target of $187.50 per ADR.</p>
<p>-- the ADR closed Thursday at 159-5/8.</p>
</text>
